models[i].call 深相等；expires_at_i = selected_at + lease_ttl_s + i * timeout_s。handle 只在同时满足三点时生成：call 非空、模型为 callable 且未过 TTL、额度检查通过。完整视图（admin select 或带会话的 HTTP）另加 detail:{model_key:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', cli:'claude', vendor:'anthropic', funding:'plan', pools:[], forecast:{}, direct_call:{command:'claude', args:['-p','--model','claude-sonnet-5-5','--output-format','stream-json','--verbose','--permission-mode','plan'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', env_names:['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']}}。draft 视图为 0.1 的扁平形状 key/provider/id/level/prices/quota/forecast/call，不含 cli 键。【4 Event v1（run 的 stdout，JSONL）】{schema:'cliworker.event/v1', seq:1, lease_id:'l_7d1e', type:'start', at:'...'}；type 取 start/text/usage/result/error；result 形如 {type:'result', ok:true, exit_code:0, text:'...', usage:{input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300}}；error 形如 {type:'error', code:'E_PROVIDER_QUOTA', retryable:false, message:'...'}。【5 注册表（T-004 冻结，contracts/registry.snapshot.json，snapshot_version:1）】退出码：0 成功（含 truncated）；1 E_INTERNAL；2 E_REQUEST_INVALID, E_LEVEL_REQUIRED, E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, E_SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, E_UNSAFE_ARG, E_UNKNOWN_COMMAND, E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；3 E_CONFIG, E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE, E_CONFIG_EXISTS, E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE, E_SECRET_BACKEND；4 E_STATE_LOCKED, E_TIMEOUT（可重试）；5 E_NO_CANDIDATE, E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA（可重试）；6 E_LEASE_UNKNOWN, E_LEASE_EXPIRED（可重试，需重新申请）, E_LEASE_CONSUMED, E_LEASE_CONFIG_MISMATCH；7 E_PROVIDER_AUTH, E_PROVIDER_QUOTA, E_PROVIDER_FAILED；8 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED, E_READONLY, E_CSRF（对应 HTTP 403）；9 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED, E_SMOKE_DISABLED。警告码：W_FIELD_IGNORED, W_FIELD_DEPRECATED, W_CONFIG_V1, W_STALE_DATA, W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED, W_MODELS_MANUAL_REQUIRED, W_LEGACY_USAGE。v1 拒选原因：excluded, level_mismatch, level_unassigned, availability_unverified, availability_blocked, availability_unavailable, availability_stale, deprecated, identity_unverified, identity_mismatch, readonly_unavailable, adapter_unverified, quota_low, quota_unknown_policy, reserve_protected；not_allowed 只出现在管理视图。draft 拒选原因：excluded, not_in_workspace_order, level:<Level>, availability:<state>, identity_unverified, readonly_unavailable, E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION。forecast 的 reason：no_samples, capacity_unknown, ledger_capacity_unknown, credits_conversion_missing, usd_samples_missing, reading_stale, window_unknown。risk 取 ok/low_reserve/critical/exhausted/unknown；risk_basis 取 tasks/usd/fraction/none；tasks_left_basis 取 tasks/usd/none。阈值表：tasks 依据下 ≤0 为 exhausted、1..2 为 critical、3..5 为 low_reserve、≥6 为 ok；fraction 依据下 ≤0 为 exhausted、<0.05 为 critical、<0.15 为 low_reserve、其余为 ok；优先级 tasks > usd > fraction > unknown。可用性取 unverified/callable/blocked/unavailable/deprecated；identity 取 verified/unverified/mismatch。语义变更标记（semantic_change）：forecast.tasks_left、forecast.risk。【6 额度池】{id:'claude:plan-5h', cli:'claude', kind:'plan_window', funding:'plan', window:{length_s:18000, anchor:'rolling', start_at:'...', reset_at:'...', reset_source:'cli|config|estimated|unknown'}, capacity_mtok:{'claude:claude-opus-5-5':{value:2, source:'config'}, 'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5':{value:10, source:'measured', confidence:'medium'}}, used_fraction:{value:0.5, source:'cli', at:'...'}, credits_per_mtok:null}。kind 取 plan_window/plan_weekly/credits/prepaid_usd；funding 取 plan/paid。v1 配置的 quotas 映射：remaining_pct 映射为计划内池，used=1-pct/100；remaining+credits 映射为 credits 池；remaining_usd 映射为 prepaid_usd 池；unit tokens 映射为容量已知的池。【7 forecast v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.forecast/v1', status:'known|unknown', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, pools:[{pool_id:'claude:plan-5h', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, reset_at:'...', reset_in_h:3, reset_source:'cli'}], tokens_per_task:{p25:0.05, p50:0.2, p90:0.9, n:12}, tasks_left:5, tasks_left_basis:'tasks', tasks_left_assumed:null, burn_mtok_per_hour:1.1, eta_exhaust_at:'...', exhausts_before_reset:false, risk:'ok', risk_basis:'tasks', confidence:'medium', reason:null, burn_per_task:0.42, samples:12}。公式：remaining(m)=min_p cap_p(m)*(1-clamp(used_p))；有新鲜读数（age<=reading_ttl_s，默认 600）时 used_p=reading+sum(读数之后的行) tokens_i/(cap_p(model_i)*1e6)，否则为窗口内的同样求和；窗口内任一行的模型容量未知时为 unknown(ledger_capacity_unknown)。计费 tokens=input+output+cache_write+cache_read_weight*cache_read，cache_read_weight 默认 0。分位数用 nearest-rank：sorted[ceil(p*n)-1]，n>=3；Heavy/Normal/Light 分别取 p90/p50/p25。tasks_left=floor(remaining/分位数)。样本不足时 tasks_left 为 null，tasks_left_assumed=floor(remaining/policy.usage_estimate_mtok[usage])，confidence 为 none，risk 只能来自 fraction 依据或为 unknown。confidence：n=0 为 none，1..4 为 low，5..19 为 medium，>=20 为 high（变异系数>1 时降为 medium）。burn=窗口内已用 Mtok/max(距窗口起点的小时数,1/60)；eta=now+remaining/burn；输出保留 3 位小数，四舍五入远离零。容量学习：只用 Δfraction>=0.01 的读数对，cap=sum(tokens)/sum(Δfraction)/1e6，k<3 为 low，3..9 为 medium，>=10 为 high。【8 选模策略】est 取分位数，样本不足时取 assumed 值；avail_p=remaining_p-有效预留-(importance 为 normal 时 reserve_fraction_for_high*cap_p)。A 类：计划内池全部已知且 min avail>=est，按紧迫度 min_p remaining_p/max(reset_in_h_p,0.25) 降序，再按价格升序、key 升序。B 类：计划内剩余未知且 unknown_policy 为 after_known，按 key 升序。C 类：付费池已知且 >=est，标 funding paid，按价格升序、key 升序。count>1 时先按 identity_group 去重贪心选，再按顺序补齐。【9 用量行 cliworker.usage/v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.usage/v1', id:'u_1', idempotency_key:'l_7d1e:post', lease_id:'l_7d1e', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', pools:['claude:plan-5h'], kind:'task|probe|manual', input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300, cache_read_tokens:0, cache_write_tokens:0, cost_usd:0.0081, pool_fraction_before:0.48, pool_fraction_after:0.5, at:'...'}。同一 idempotency_key 写入时返回已有 id，读取时只计一次。【10 cliworker.model/v1 与 inventory/v1】model：{schema:'cliworker.model/v1', key, id, cli, provider, vendor, aliases, allowed, level, level_source:{kind:'config|measured|cli', ref, at}, availability:{state, reason, at, ttl_s, evidence:{probe_id, cmd_redacted, exit, duration_ms, nonce_ok, reported_model, tokens}}, identity, capabilities:{context_tokens, readonly, stdin}, prices:{input_per_mtok, output_per_mtok, source}, source:{kind:'subcommand|help|cache|api|manual', ref, at}, deprecated}。inventory：{schema:'cliworker.inventory/v1', generated_at, host:{platform, arch, wsl_distros:[]}, entries:[{id, recognized, platform:'win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>', path, realpath, version, fingerprint:{size, mtime, realpath}, auth:{state:'logged_in|logged_out|token_ref|unknown', source:'cli_status'}, evidence:[{kind, cmd_redacted, exit, at, digest}], first_seen, last_seen, status:'present|gone'}]}。【11 配置 cliworker.config/v2 与路径】{schema:'cliworker.config/v2', state_dir:'./state', secrets:{kimi:{ref:'env:KIMI_API_KEY'}}, discovery:{extra_dirs:[], wsl:true, probe_unknown:false, unknown_patterns:['*-cli','*agent*'], cli_overrides:{}}, catalog:{allow:[], levels:{}, aliases:{}, deprecated:{}, manual:[]}, pools:[], policy:{probe_ttl_s:21600, lease_ttl_s:7200, reading_ttl_s:600, lock_stale_ms:30000, lock_wait_ms:5000, reserve_fraction_for_high:0.15, unknown_policy:'after_known|reject', usage_estimate_mtok:{Heavy:2, Normal:0.5, Light:0.1}, cache_read_weight:0, probe_schedule:null}}。resolvePaths({configPath, env})：configPath 依次取参数、CLIWORKER_CONFIG、CLIWORKER_HOME/config.json；state_dir 依次取显式值（相对路径按配置文件所在目录解析）、CLIWORKER_HOME/state/<sha256(规范化绝对路径，win32 下转小写) 前 12 位>。CLI 与插件共用这一个函数。没有 schema 或 schema 为 v1 的配置按 v1 处理，在内存中迁移并给 W_CONFIG_V1。带 _example:true，或解析后（忽略 _example）与随包 example 深相等的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。【12 HTTP 路由分级】AgentLine 级：POST /cliworker/select，只输出 AgentLine 视图，带 view 或 compat 但无会话时返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN。管理级（需要 x-cliworker-session，由 GET /cliworker/api/session 签发，只对 loopback 来源签发，保存在内存中）：GET /cliworker/providers、GET /cliworker/models、GET /cliworker/forecast?model=<key>、GET /cliworker/ui、GET /cliworker/api/snapshot?since=<rev>、GET /cliworker/api/jobs/<id>、POST /cliworker/api/discover|enumerate|probe|read-usage（返回 job_id）、POST /cliworker/api/allow|deny|level|alias|manual-model|pool、POST /cliworker/api/secret（只写，响应只有 state:'set'）。写接口另需 x-cliworker-csrf，readonly 时返回 E_READONLY。公共：GET /cliworker/health 返回 {status:'ok|degraded', checks:[{id, ok, detail}], registration:'ok|failed'}，不含 provider 细节。【13 CLI】init | paths | doctor | discover [--full] [--probe-unknown] | models enumerate|list|add|allow|deny|level|alias|probe|forecast|select | admin select | pools list|set | usage record|summary|import | cli resolve --model <key> --cwd <p> [--platform win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>] [--readonly] | run --lease <id> --state-dir <d> --config <c> | auth set <cli> [--from-env NAME]（不加该参数时从 stdin 读）|status|clear | config migrate --in <v1> --out <v2> | state backup|restore|migrate | --version。除 run 输出 JSONL 外，所有命令的 stdout 都是单个 JSON，错误体为 {ok:false, error:{code, message, retryable, retry_after}}，退出码按注册表。【14 宿主契约 contracts/host/dsh-host.v1.json】ctx.inject(['webServer'], fn(httpCtx))；httpCtx.effect(fn, name)；httpCtx.webServer.register({kind:'exact', path, handler(req,res)})。createPlugin(hostCtx, settings, deps) 返回 {registered:[path], errors:[{path, message}]}；getRegistration() 返回 {status:'ok|failed', registered, errors}；strict:true 时注册失败直接抛出。【15 测试设施格式】跳过记录：{schema:'cliworker.skip/v1', test, file, ac:'AC-027', requires:'win32|wsl|darwin|linux|pwsh|secret-tool|security', platform, node, reason, at}。追踪分片 test/traceability/<T>.json：{task:'T-006', entries:[{ac:'AC-015', files:['test/unit/pools.test.mjs'], baseline:['linux'], status:'planned|covered'}]}，baseline 可取 linux/win32/darwin/smoke。smoke 报告：{schema:'cliworker.smoke/v1', mode:'real|dry-run', version, platform, node, steps:[{id, mandatory, status:'pass|fail|skip', reason, duration_ms}], redacted:true}。全流程步骤 test/flows/steps/<id>.mjs 导出 {id, introduced_by, run(env)}，必需集合为 auth, doctor, discover, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select, http-admin。test/helpers/ctx.mjs 提供 fakeExec（记录 argv 与 env 名，统计调用次数）、fakeFs（访问探针）、fixedNow、fakeFetch。\n","numLines":2,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016zr2y8u7CckShYq792JjKy","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
